# Agreement timelines for cereals and rice review.

This scope computes the key dates related to the understanding reached between the European Community and the United States regarding cereals and rice.

```catala
declaration scope AgreementTimeline:
  input agreement_date content date
  output agreement_effective_date content date
  output review_start_date content date
  output withdrawal_request_date content date
```

## Agreement effective date

The understanding is confirmed on the date of the letter.

```catala
scope AgreementTimeline:
  date round down
  definition agreement_effective_date equals agreement_date
```

## Review period start

The review of the 'representative price' system is scheduled to begin in the first quarter of 1996.

```catala
scope AgreementTimeline:
  definition review_start_date equals |1996-01-01|
```

## Withdrawal request date

The United States withdraws its current request made in November 1995.

```catala
scope AgreementTimeline:
  definition withdrawal_request_date equals |1995-11-01|
```